--- Third-party material -------------------------------------------------

Colour values in static/palettes/github.json reproduce GitHub's Primer design
tokens (https://primer.style), MIT licensed.

SVG path data in src/github_markdown/icons.py is from GitHub's Octicons
(https://primer.style/octicons), MIT licensed.

tests/data/commonmark_spec.json is derived from the CommonMark specification
test suite (https://spec.commonmark.org), CC-BY-SA 4.0.

static/palettes/cream.json matches the cream theme of the pi-web-app chat UI;
it is an original theme for this project, not extracted from any third-party
product.
